(7535366, 1204597, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Lovely canoe all splintered up into interesting shapes and forms, but still clearly a canoe shot from overhead.  I see I gave this a 6 so I liked it  :-) However as tends to happen in challenges which revolve around a fairly narrow sphere - Cubism in this case - the voters seem to prefer voting for what meets their idea of that particular artistic style.  But it''s still an excellent effort in a very difficult challenge, and if it''s any consolation, you beat me! :-)<br/> <br/>take care and please continue to enter,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Lovely canoe all splintered up into interesting shapes and forms, but still clearly a canoe shot from overhead.  I see I gave this a 6 so I liked it  :-) However as tends to happen in challenges which revolve around a fairly narrow sphere - Cubism in this case - the voters seem to prefer voting for what meets their idea of that particular artistic style.  But it''s still an excellent effort in a very difficult challenge, and if it''s any consolation, you beat me! :-) take care and please continue to enter, Susan', '2017-09-16 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535372, 1204988, 74588, '<td valign="top">also love the texture</td>', 'also love the texture', '2017-09-16 22:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535400, 1205229, 114969, '<td valign="top">You definitely are an artist. Mixing several of your skills into one result is such a great idea! I''m convinced this could be the start of fantastic series. I know I would love to see more in the future. Meanwhile, congrats on the nice finish and the fabulous concept!</td>', 'You definitely are an artist. Mixing several of your skills into one result is such a great idea! I''m convinced this could be the start of fantastic series. I know I would love to see more in the future. Meanwhile, congrats on the nice finish and the fabulous concept!', '2017-09-17 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535401, 1205249, 114969, '<td valign="top">So beautiful. This definitely doesn''t need a "cubism" topic to shine, it is just beautiful, regardless of the context. A great achievement imho.</td>', 'So beautiful. This definitely doesn''t need a "cubism" topic to shine, it is just beautiful, regardless of the context. A great achievement imho.', '2017-09-17 13:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535402, 1205004, 114969, '<td valign="top">Art out of art. It is impressive to see how a clever approach transformed this statue (I believe it is one?) into something entirely new. Using a limited palette and detailed shapes fits this so perfectly!</td>', 'Art out of art. It is impressive to see how a clever approach transformed this statue (I believe it is one?) into something entirely new. Using a limited palette and detailed shapes fits this so perfectly!', '2017-09-17 13:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535407, 1205210, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>A great interpretation of the challenge theme Susan. I like the creative pixellated look youve achieved here, Im also curious how you have managed it? It works well and definitely deserved a higher score for its originality alone.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well A great interpretation of the challenge theme Susan. I like the creative pixellated look youve achieved here, Im also curious how you have managed it? It works well and definitely deserved a higher score for its originality alone.', '2017-09-17 13:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7535444, 1205249, 86447, '<td valign="top">THREE out of THREE on the front page.<br/> <br/>Someone''s upping his game!   <br/> <br/>Kudos to you, Mark!<br/></td>', 'THREE out of THREE on the front page. Someone''s upping his game!    Kudos to you, Mark!', '2017-09-17 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
